            "action_name": {
              "value": "Splash Poison"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Franca uncorks and flings a dose of poison at a bleeding foe. She retrieves a poison from her inventory, then splashes it at a creature within 10 feet that is currently taking persistent bleed damage. The creature must succeed at a DC 32 Reflex save or be exposed to the poison."
            },
